invariant: INV-14
file: srv_parser.c
catches: srv_test
reason: parse_head checks that legacy_compression_methods holds one byte and
  not that the byte is zero, so a hello asking for DEFLATE parses. RFC
  9846 §4.2.2 makes any value but the single zero byte an
  illegal_parameter (rfc9846.txt:1284-1288), and test/srv_parser_tests.h
  requires that alert for the byte 0x01.

--- old
    if (compression_len != 1 || compression[0] != 0) {
--- new
    if (compression_len != 1) {
